    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, but it doesn't really feel like compassion anymore. it just feels heavy. like i'm carrying all this trauma around and for what? just to see more of it tomorrow? it feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just... stop. everything. it's just so much noise and pain and it never ends.",
